{"id":"90eb7ba7-26e0-4bf4-a5de-4904be410fb8","expr":"name != null || x == -1","rationale":"If the name is null, the method returns -1, so before normal computation x must not be -1 unless name is null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"com.example.Foo#bar(int,String):int","file":"com/example/Foo.java","createdAt":"2026-04-21T22:21:40.267358Z"}
{"id":"3d7616e5-bb07-4b09-9310-13e196dc0d13","expr":"args != null","rationale":"It is common for the main entry point to be invoked with a non-null args array.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"com.example.Main#main(String[]):void","file":"com/example/Main.java","createdAt":"2026-04-21T22:21:40.267918Z"}
{"id":"e0b904b0-6805-474a-b4bd-d75c6f80c835","expr":"args != null","rationale":"Main methods typically expect args to be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"com.example.Main#main(String[]):void","file":"com/example/Main.java","createdAt":"2026-04-21T22:21:40.268968Z"}
{"id":"2c05bdef-fd4b-44bb-8772-4fb109ef7394","expr":"name == null || name.length() >= 0","rationale":"If name is non-null, its length is at least zero.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"com.example.Foo#bar(int,String):int","file":"com/example/Foo.java","createdAt":"2026-04-21T22:21:40.267358Z"}
{"id":"61b645b4-66a0-4f79-b94b-48173fcf128f","expr":"args.length >= 0","rationale":"Array length is always non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"com.example.Main#main(String[]):void","file":"com/example/Main.java","createdAt":"2026-04-21T22:21:40.268968Z"}
{"id":"3cec330a-cc09-4e10-964b-781d16710485","expr":"(name == null && result == -1) || (name != null && result == x + name.length())","rationale":"Describes exactly how 'result' is determined by the state of 'name'.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"com.example.Foo#bar(int,String):int","file":"com/example/Foo.java","createdAt":"2026-04-21T22:21:40.269219Z"}
{"id":"84f7f2d9-fff4-44bb-bc62-84e8e221bba1","expr":"args.length >= 0","rationale":"All arrays in Java have a non-negative length.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"com.example.Main#main(String[]):void","file":"com/example/Main.java","createdAt":"2026-04-21T22:21:40.267918Z"}
{"id":"52c55e34-db6a-4ca6-a912-ff6924882054","expr":"name == null || result >= x","rationale":"If 'name' is not null, result is x + length >= x; otherwise, result could be -1 < x only if x > -1.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"com.example.Foo#bar(int,String):int","file":"com/example/Foo.java","createdAt":"2026-04-21T22:21:40.269219Z"}
{"id":"2eead35c-a0e7-4d6b-9ae9-c6eb3422e787","expr":"name != null || true","rationale":"For all inputs at method entry, name may be null or non-null (this is safe, non-trivial in some contexts as the branch is explicit in the code).","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"com.example.Foo#bar(int,String):int","file":"com/example/Foo.java","createdAt":"2026-04-21T22:21:40.267358Z"}
{"id":"8c9d741b-88c1-49d4-9b07-1208f68830c5","expr":"name != null || result == -1","rationale":"If name is null, result must be -1.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"com.example.Foo#bar(int,String):int","file":"com/example/Foo.java","createdAt":"2026-04-21T22:21:40.269219Z"}
{"id":"f83bf562-0872-4718-808a-bc3a2771aa91","expr":"name == null || result == x + name.length()","rationale":"If name is non-null, result is always computed as x + name.length().","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"com.example.Foo#bar(int,String):int","file":"com/example/Foo.java","createdAt":"2026-04-21T22:21:40.269219Z"}
{"id":"c9207396-7e85-49b7-8c7a-88406f62cab3","expr":"result >= -1","rationale":"Result is at least -1 for any input.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"com.example.Foo#bar(int,String):int","file":"com/example/Foo.java","createdAt":"2026-04-21T22:21:40.269219Z"}
